*Heading
** Fixture: IM7/8552 [0/45/-45/45/0]s coupon, 10 mm by 80 mm, 2 by 8 S4R elements, gripped at both ends through kinematic
** couplings to reference nodes, 0.8 mm imposed axial displacement (1 % nominal strain), linear static. Same structure as the
** team's Abaqus/CAE coupon decks (parts, instance, assembly sets, node surfaces, couplings, PRESELECT output).
** Units: mm-MPa. Material: public library dataset ncamp-im7-8552-2019-rtd-measured-v1 in MPa (see coupon-1x1-im7-8552.inp);
** G13 = G12 and G23 nominal, unused. The bottom coupled set also lists its own reference node on purpose: the team's deck
** does this, and the reader must drop the reference node from the coupled nodes and say so.
